        "type": "Module",
        "name": "led_driver",
        "description": "PT4115 buck constant-current driver for 1W LED at 350mA. VIN pin receives 12V-24V input. GND is common system ground. SW pin is switching node driving high-side of LED. CSN pin is current-sense negative input; requires external low-side shunt resistor to GND for setting LED current (350mA). DIM pin is PWM dimming input; external PWM logic signal controls brightness. EP (thermal pad) must be thermally connected to system ground plane.",
        "id": "led_driver"
      },
